  "headline": "Of 114,071 FHIR REST endpoints in the 2026-05-08 NDH release, 19,334 (16.9%) resolve to a managing organization. The remaining 94,737 are URLs with no owner in the directory. Every endpoint that does resolve reaches an organization carrying an NPI, so the link yields a usable base-URL-to-NPI crosswalk for 19,334 endpoints across 18,884 organizations.",
